## 14. SHIPPING AND DELIVERY POLICY

**Page title:** Shipping and Delivery Policy

Delivery arrangements depend on the product category, destination, order size and confirmed availability.

For Kitchen orders, customers should confirm the service area, estimated preparation time and delivery or collection options directly with our team.

For packaged Namkeen and Mithai orders, customers should confirm shipping availability, applicable charges, dispatch timelines and estimated delivery with Bika Bite before placing an order.

Delivery timelines are estimates unless expressly confirmed otherwise.

**Before publication, the business must add:**
- Actual Kitchen service locations
- Packaged-goods shipping coverage
- Dispatch and delivery timelines
- Delivery charges and any applicable conditions
- Contact details for delivery-related questions

Do not promise nationwide delivery or a specific delivery time unless the business can fulfil it.

---

## 15. CANCELLATION AND REFUND POLICY

**Page title:** Cancellation and Refund Policy

Orders are handled directly by the Bika Bite team. Customers should contact the team as soon as possible if they need to request a change or cancellation.

Whether an order can be changed or cancelled depends on its status, preparation or dispatch stage and the applicable product requirements.

If a customer receives a damaged, incorrect or otherwise problematic order, they should contact Bika Bite promptly and provide the order details and relevant photographs, where appropriate.

Any refund, replacement or other resolution will be assessed under the business's published policy and applicable consumer law.

**Before publication, the business must confirm:**
- Cancellation cut-off rules
- Refund eligibility
- Treatment of perishable and made-to-order products
- Process for damaged, missing or incorrect orders
- Refund processing method and timelines
- Official complaints contact

This draft must be reviewed and finalised to match the actual operating process and applicable law. Do not publish an unconditional “no refunds” claim without appropriate legal review.

