## 16. PRIVACY POLICY

**Page title:** Privacy Policy

Bika Bite may collect information that customers provide through contact forms, WhatsApp conversations, telephone enquiries and business enquiry forms.

Depending on the interaction, this information may include a name, phone number, email address, business details, delivery location and order requirements.

The information should be used only for appropriate purposes, such as responding to enquiries, confirming orders, arranging fulfilment, handling complaints and managing business relationships.

Information should be accessible only to authorised people and service providers who need it for legitimate business purposes, subject to applicable law and contractual safeguards.

Customers should be informed of the applicable data practices, retention periods, contact channel for privacy requests and any relevant third-party processing.

**Before publication, add and verify:**
- Legal name of the business responsible for the data
- Official privacy contact
- Actual data collection and retention practices
- Relevant service providers and integrations
- Applicable rights and complaint procedures
- Any cookies or analytics actually used by the website

The final policy must reflect the website's real technical implementation and applicable privacy law.

