## 19. WHATSAPP ORDERING — REQUIRED FUNCTIONALITY

The developer must connect every relevant WhatsApp button to the official business WhatsApp number.

Use this URL structure:

`https://wa.me/[COUNTRYCODEANDNUMBER]?text=[URL_ENCODED_MESSAGE]`

Use the country code and number without a plus sign, spaces or punctuation. Encode the prefilled message correctly.

### General Enquiry Message

Hello Bika Bite team, I would like to know more about your products and services. Please assist me.

### Kitchen Message

Hello Bika Bite Kitchen, I would like to enquire about placing an order.

Item: [ITEM NAME]

Quantity: [QUANTITY]

Delivery or collection location: [LOCATION]

Please confirm availability and pricing.

### Namkeen Message

Hello Bika Bite team, I am interested in your Namkeen range.

Product: [PRODUCT NAME]

Pack size: [PACK SIZE]

Quantity: [QUANTITY]

Please confirm availability, price and delivery options.

### Mithai Message

Hello Bika Bite team, I would like to enquire about Mithai.

Product or gift box: [PRODUCT NAME]

Quantity: [QUANTITY]

Required date: [DATE]

Delivery city: [CITY]

Please share availability and pricing.

### Wholesale Message

Hello Bika Bite team, I am interested in a wholesale or distribution enquiry.

Business name: [BUSINESS NAME]

City: [CITY]

Products of interest: [PRODUCTS]

Please contact me to discuss your business terms.

### Bulk Order Message

Hello Bika Bite team, I would like to enquire about a bulk order.

Order type: [ORDER TYPE]

Products: [PRODUCTS]

Quantity: [QUANTITY]

Required date: [DATE]

Location: [LOCATION]

Please contact me to discuss the details.

**Technical requirements:**
- Open the official WhatsApp account.
- Prefill the correct message for the relevant product or page.
- Do not claim that an order has been placed merely because WhatsApp opened.
- The customer must send the message themselves.
- Test every button on desktop and mobile.

