## 21. FORMS AND LEAD MANAGEMENT

All contact, bulk-order and partnership forms must be functional.

Required behaviour:

1. Validate required fields.
2. Validate phone number and email format where applicable.
3. Prevent accidental duplicate submissions where practical.
4. Submit the form to a configured backend, approved CRM or business email workflow.
5. Store and protect submitted information appropriately.
6. Display a success message only after successful submission.
7. Display a clear error message if submission fails.
8. Provide a fallback contact option if the form cannot be submitted.
9. Configure spam protection.
10. Test the complete flow before launch.

Suggested success message:

“Thank you for contacting Bika Bite. Your enquiry has been submitted successfully. Our team will contact you using the details you provided.”

Use this message only when the backend confirms successful submission.

